---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Diagram from '../components/Diagram.astro';
import { Content } from '../content/architecture.md';
import { href } from '../lib/constants.mjs';
---
<SiteLayout title="Architecture — Nora Intelligence System" description="System architecture for the Nora intelligence system: Browser UI, Coordination, and MCP gateway with clear service boundaries." path="/architecture/">
  <article class="container content-page">
    <h1>Architecture</h1>
    <p class="intro-text">One assistant coordinates retrieval and inference while PostgreSQL retains conversation state. Browser access, MCP access, retrieval, and manual ingestion have separate responsibilities.</p>

    <nav class="anchor-nav" aria-label="Architecture sections">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#system-map">System map</a></li>
        <li><a href="#purpose">Purpose</a></li>
        <li><a href="#request-path">Request path</a></li>
        <li><a href="#manual-ingestion">Manual ingestion</a></li>
        <li><a href="#decisions-tradeoffs">Decisions & tradeoffs</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <section id="system-map" class="diagram-section">
      <h2>System map</h2>
      <Diagram
        title="System architecture"
        previewSrc="/diagrams/01-system-architecture-preview.svg"
        htmlUrl="/diagrams/01-system-architecture.html"
        gifUrl="/diagrams/01-system-architecture.gif"
        sourcePath="architecture/diagrams/01-system-architecture.html"
        alt="System architecture diagram showing Browser UI AG-UI connects directly to Coordination. MCP clients separately use LiteLLM MCP gateway to embedded FastMCP or direct FastMCP."
        caption="The system architecture: Browser UI (AG-UI) connects directly to Coordination. MCP clients separately use LiteLLM MCP gateway → embedded FastMCP or direct FastMCP. Coordination does NOT call gateway for external tools; owns DeepAgents LangGraph, selector and checkpoints; inference Ollama Cloud Fireworks. Retrieval MCP BGE Qdrant prepared text; manual jobs outside conversation."
      />
    </section>

    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <Content />
    </div>

    <section id="request-path" class="diagram-section">
      <h2>Request path</h2>
      <Diagram
        previewSrc="/diagrams/architecture-request-path-preview.svg"
        htmlUrl="/diagrams/architecture-request-path.html"
        gifUrl="/diagrams/architecture-request-path.gif"
        sourcePath="architecture/diagrams/architecture-request-path.html"
        alt="Architecture request path diagram"
        caption="The request path shows how Coordination handles inference and retrieval directly."
      />
    </section>

    <section id="manual-ingestion" class="diagram-section">
      <h2>Manual ingestion</h2>
      <Diagram
        previewSrc="/diagrams/manual-ingestion-preview.svg"
        htmlUrl="/diagrams/manual-ingestion.html"
        gifUrl="/diagrams/manual-ingestion.gif"
        sourcePath="architecture/diagrams/manual-ingestion.html"
        alt="Manual ingestion pipeline diagram"
        caption="Manual ingestion runs outside the conversation flow to prepare text for retrieval."
      />
    </section>

    <section id="decisions-tradeoffs" class="diagram-section">
      <h2>Decisions & tradeoffs</h2>
      <p>For full details on architectural decisions and tradeoffs, see the <a href={href('/decisions/')}>Decisions route</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.content-page { padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px; }
.content-page :global(p) { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 66ch; }
.content-page :global(h2) { margin-top: 2.5em; }
.content-page :global(ul), .content-page :global(ol) { max-width: 66ch; }

.intro-text {
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--color-body);
  max-width: 70ch;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

.anchor-nav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 100px;
  background: var(--color-cool);
  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 16px 24px;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
  z-index: 10;
}
.anchor-nav ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 24px;
}
.anchor-nav a {
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--color-secondary);
}
.anchor-nav a:hover {
  color: var(--color-teal);
  text-decoration: underline;
}

.diagram-section { margin-top: 32px; }
.diagram-section > h2 { margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px; }

.content-wrapper :global(h2) {
  padding-top: 80px;
  margin-top: -40px;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .anchor-nav {
    position: static;
  }
  .anchor-nav ul {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
}
</style>
